WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.404
Welcome to Orbit. A place to call home. Our focus is there is / there are.

2
00:00:07.404 --> 00:00:11.418
Use there is for one thing and there are for more than one thing.

3
00:00:11.418 --> 00:00:13.947
There is a desk near the window.

4
00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:16.836
There are two bedrooms in our flat.

5
00:00:16.836 --> 00:00:19.615
Is there a garden behind the house?

6
00:00:19.615 --> 00:00:29.013
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
